# Placeholder so the `db/` directory exists in the repo.
#
# This directory was previously referenced by the Dockerfile for
# `db/full-schema.sql`. The Prisma migration system (prisma/migrations)
# is now the single source of truth for the database schema, so this
# folder is intentionally empty. It is kept here only to make the
# historical `COPY --from=builder /app/db ./db` no-op safe and to
# document where one-off SQL scripts (e.g. seed backfills, custom
# indexes) should live if needed in the future.
